abstract: >
  Low-cost computer vision system for automated inspection of USB Type-A
  connectors in mobile phone chargers. The software integrates QR code
  identification, image acquisition, region-of-interest processing,
  MobileNetV2 multiclass classification, operator interface, traceability,
  production statistics, and automated reporting. Version 2.2.3 corresponds
  to the Production Candidate release validated for pilot use under real
  industrial conditions.

